  objectives:
  - id: 1
    title: Isolate production power
    instructions: Shut off the PRODUCTION branch at the west breaker. Leave the cold-store
      circuit connected so the T9-17 case stays refrigerated.
    result: Production power isolated.
    hint: Check the west breaker panel and read Factory Utilities Procedure.
    hint2: Isolate the PRODUCTION branch first; do not cut power to Cold Storage.
    hint3: Hold [F] at the West Production Breaker marked by the POWER waypoint.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 1
  - id: 2
    title: Engage cold-store backup
    instructions: Switch the east panel to BACKUP COLD STORE feed so the refrigeration
      generator can start.
    result: Cold-store backup engaged.
    hint: Production is isolated. Move to the east backup feed panel.
    hint2: Follow the POWER waypoint to the east breaker and switch on the backup
      feed.
    hint3: Hold [F] at the East Cold-Store Backup Panel to ready the generator.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 1
  - id: 3
    title: Start cold-store generator
    instructions: Pull the physical generator control lever to restore cold-store
      power. Ignore the green alarm lamp—it lights before the contactor closes.
    result: Cold-store power restored.
    hint: Backup feed is ready. Find the cold-store generator control.
    hint2: Do not rely on the green lamp. Use the physical generator lever.
    hint3: Hold [F] at the Cold-Store Generator lever following the POWER waypoint.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 1
  - id: 4
    title: Read delivery manifest
    instructions: Collect the original Delivery Manifest to log the shipment number,
      security seal, destination, and intake time.
    result: Delivery manifest recorded in Journal.
    hint: Follow the LOGISTICS waypoint to find the Delivery Manifest.
    hint2: Look for the paper manifest near the dispatch desk in the factory.
    hint3: Press [F] on the Delivery Manifest sheet to save AL-04 / K6 details.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 2
  - id: 5
    title: Verify shipping release
    instructions: Match both shipment fields against your recorded Delivery Manifest
      (FILE_02). Wrong selections do not lock the terminal.
